{"seq":1,"slug":"loading-wasm-modules","title":"加载 WASM 模块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/typescript-integration/loading-wasm-modules","wordCount":831,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"加载-wasm-模块\">加载 WASM 模块</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在工程化前端里加载 WASM，核心是<strong>让构建工具与浏览器都能高效处理 <code>.wasm</code> 资源</strong>。浏览器侧应优先使用 <code>instantiateStreaming</code>，它把编译与下载并行起来，还能命中浏览器的编译缓存。构建工具侧，Vite 通过 <code>vite-plugin-wasm</code> 提供开箱即用的支持（<code>?init</code>/<code>?url</code> 等导入方式），webpack 5 则依赖 <code>asyncWebAssembly</code> 实验特性。大型应用还需进一步：用动态导入拆分模块、结合预加载与 Service Worker 缓存，而多模块协作可通过共享内存或模块注册表完成。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"webassembly-instantiate-vs-instantiatestreaming\">WebAssembly.instantiate vs instantiateStreaming</h2><p>浏览器提供两组 API 来加载 WASM 模块，选择正确的 API 直接影响加载性能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const importObject = {&#10;  env: { log: (v: number) =&gt; console.log(v) },&#10;};&#10;&#10;const streamingResult = await WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming(fetch(&#39;/module.wasm&#39;), importObject);&#10;const { instance, module } = streamingResult;&#10;&#10;const response = await fetch(&#39;/module.wasm&#39;);&#10;const bytes = await response.arrayBuffer();&#10;const bufferResult = await WebAssembly.instantiate(bytes, importObject);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> importObject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  env: { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> streamingResult</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">instantiateStreaming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/module.wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), importObject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">instance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> streamingResult;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/module.wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bytes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arrayBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bufferResult</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">instantiate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bytes, importObject);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>流式编译</th>\n<th>缓存优化</th>\n<th>推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>instantiateStreaming</code></td>\n<td><code>Response</code>/<code>Promise</code></td>\n<td>✅ 是</td>\n<td>✅ 是</td>\n<td>浏览器首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>instantiate</code></td>\n<td><code>ArrayBuffer</code></td>\n<td>❌ 否</td>\n<td>❌ 否</td>\n<td>降级/Node.js</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>compileStreaming</code></td>\n<td><code>Response</code>/<code>Promise</code></td>\n<td>✅ 是</td>\n<td>✅ 是</td>\n<td>分离编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>compile</code></td>\n<td><code>ArrayBuffer</code></td>\n<td>❌ 否</td>\n<td>❌ 否</td>\n<td>降级方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as 应用&#10;    participant Net as 网络&#10;    participant Engine as WASM 引擎&#10;&#10;    Note over App,Engine: instantiateStreaming (推荐)&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Net: fetch(&quot;/module.wasm&quot;)&#10;    Net--&gt;&gt;Engine: 流式传输字节&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 边下载边编译&#10;    Engine--&gt;&gt;App: Instance 就绪&#10;&#10;    Note over App,Engine: instantiate (降级)&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Net: fetch + arrayBuffer()&#10;    Net--&gt;&gt;App: 完整字节数组&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Engine: 传入 ArrayBuffer&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 开始编译&#10;    Engine--&gt;&gt;App: Instance 就绪\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as 应用\n    participant Net as 网络\n    participant Engine as WASM 引擎\n\n    Note over App,Engine: instantiateStreaming (推荐)\n    App-&gt;&gt;Net: fetch(\"/module.wasm\")\n    Net--&gt;&gt;Engine: 流式传输字节\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 边下载边编译\n    Engine--&gt;&gt;App: Instance 就绪\n\n    Note over App,Engine: instantiate (降级)\n    App-&gt;&gt;Net: fetch + arrayBuffer()\n    Net--&gt;&gt;App: 完整字节数组\n    App-&gt;&gt;Engine: 传入 ArrayBuffer\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 开始编译\n    Engine--&gt;&gt;App: Instance 就绪</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>instantiateStreaming</code> 要求服务器返回正确的 MIME 类型 <code>Content-Type: application/wasm</code>。如果你遇到 &quot;Incorrect response MIME type&quot; 错误，检查服务器配置或降级使用 <code>instantiate</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vite-wasm-插件\">Vite WASM 插件</h2><p>Vite 对 WASM 的支持已经相当成熟，通过插件可以实现开箱即用的 WASM 集成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// vite.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;vite&#39;;&#10;import wasm from &#39;vite-plugin-wasm&#39;;&#10;import topLevelAwait from &#39;vite-plugin-top-level-await&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  plugins: [wasm(), topLevelAwait()],&#10;  optimizeDeps: {&#10;    exclude: [&#39;my-wasm-lib&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// vite.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wasm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vite-plugin-wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topLevelAwait </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vite-plugin-top-level-await'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">topLevelAwait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  optimizeDeps: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exclude: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'my-wasm-lib'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 方式 1: 通过插件直接导入&#10;import init, { greet } from &#39;my-wasm-lib&#39;;&#10;await init();&#10;greet(&#39;Vite 用户&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 方式 2: 使用 ?init 查询参数&#10;import initWasm from &#39;./module.wasm?init&#39;;&#10;const instance = await initWasm({&#10;  env: { log: console.log },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 方式 3: 使用 ?url 获取 URL&#10;import wasmUrl from &#39;./module.wasm?url&#39;;&#10;const { instance: inst } = await WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming(fetch(wasmUrl));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方式 1: 通过插件直接导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> init, { greet } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'my-wasm-lib'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Vite 用户'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方式 2: 使用 ?init 查询参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> initWasm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './module.wasm?init'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> initWasm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  env: { log: console.log },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方式 3: 使用 ?url 获取 URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wasmUrl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './module.wasm?url'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">