uot;浏览器按需加载&quot;]&#10;    WEBPACK --&gt;|&quot;wasm-pack-plugin&quot;| BUILD[&quot;自动编译 Rust&quot;]&#10;    BUILD --&gt; CHUNK\">graph TD\n    SRC[\"源码 import\"] --&gt; WEBPACK[\"webpack 5\"]\n    WEBPACK --&gt;|\"asyncWebAssembly\"| CHUNK[\"独立 chunk\"]\n    CHUNK --&gt; BROWSER[\"浏览器按需加载\"]\n    WEBPACK --&gt;|\"wasm-pack-plugin\"| BUILD[\"自动编译 Rust\"]\n    BUILD --&gt; CHUNK</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> webpack 的 <code>asyncWebAssembly</code> 会将每个 WASM 文件作为独立的异步 chunk。如果你的应用有多个小 WASM 模块，考虑合并它们以减少网络请求数。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"动态导入模式\">动态导入模式</h2><p>在大型应用中，WASM 模块通常采用动态导入（Lazy Loading），只在需要时加载。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class WasmLoader {&#10;  private instance: any = null;&#10;  private loading: Promise&lt;void&gt; | null = null;&#10;&#10;  async load(): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    if (this.instance) return;&#10;    if (this.loading) return this.loading;&#10;&#10;    this.loading = (async () =&gt; {&#10;      const module = await import(&#39;./pkg/heavy_compute.js&#39;);&#10;      await module.default();&#10;      this.instance = module;&#10;    })();&#10;&#10;    return this.loading;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async compute(data: Float64Array): Promise&lt;Float64Array&gt; {&#10;    await this.load();&#10;    return this.instance.compute(data);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;const loader = new WasmLoader();&#10;button.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  const result = await loader.compute(inputData);&#10;  render(result);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WasmLoader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97